; What the market on the ledge has to sell, for spireshop(1).
; The header names the room; after the % come the wares, one a line,
; as KEY PRICE TEXT.  The key is what the game does about it and has to
; be one of the few words spire(1) knows; the price, the text and what
; is stocked at all are this room's business.

name Ledge Market

%

jump   30 boots, and a longer jump
shield 45 a charm; takes one blow
heart  60 one more try
